This information is read-only. Home Assistant uses ONE shared MQTT connection for all integrations. To change broker address, port, credentials or TLS, open Settings → Devices & services → MQTT → Reconfigure. The Windows agent connection is separate in its protected config.yaml; changing one does not change the other. No usernames, passwords, certificates, keys or private connection URLs are displayed.

